{"id":2223,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2223"},"modified":"2025-10-02T15:12:39","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T15:12:39","slug":"rectangle-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/rectangle-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Rectangle Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"56\">Custom Rectangle Cardboard Boxes Bulk<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"337\">We at <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><em data-start=\"64\" data-end=\"86\">Shop Cardboard Boxes <\/em><\/a>provide custom <strong data-start=\"102\" data-end=\"131\">rectangle cardboard boxes<\/strong> built to handle a wide range of packaging needs. Whether you&#8217;re packing retail goods, shipping long items, or presenting products in-store, these boxes are made to deliver both presentation and protection.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"721\">Ideal for shipping, storage, or retail display, our <strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"420\">rectangle boxes for gifts<\/strong> and shipping products are available in any size you require. We serve businesses that need bulk orders, small-batch runs, or specialized box designs. You can choose from multiple material types, finishing options, and structural styles\u2014all backed by fast turnaround times and free design support.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"726\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"764\">Packaging Built for Practical Use<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"809\">Ideal for Shipping, Retail, and Storage<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"1054\">Rectangle cardboard boxes are highly efficient for packing items that are longer in shape or flat in design. From documents and picture frames to clothing and wellness products, these boxes help organize and protect your items during handling.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1243\">\n<li data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1128\">\n<p data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1128\">Suitable for office supplies, electronics, clothing, books, and more<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1181\">\n<p data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1181\">Available in single-wall or double-wall strength<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1243\">\n<p data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1243\">Lightweight material helps reduce overall shipping weight<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1365\">These boxes are designed with clean folds, straight edges, and secure flaps, making them easy to stack, label, and seal.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1407\">Available in Custom Sizes and Styles<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1540\">Whether you need compact boxes or a <strong data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1478\">long rectangular shipping box<\/strong>, we can build them according to your exact size requirements.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1723\">\n<li data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1597\">\n<p data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1597\">Rectangular boxes for shelf display or product kits<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1598\" data-end=\"1666\">\n<p data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1666\">Longer boxes for rolled items, tools, or promotional merchandise<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1723\">\n<p data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1723\">Flat boxes for prints, calendars, or folded garments<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1813\">All boxes arrive flat-packed to save storage space and can be assembled quickly on-site.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1815\" data-end=\"1818\" \/>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Dimensions<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Fully Custom (Length x Width x Height)<\/td>\n<td>Corrugated, Kraft, White SBS, Rigid Board<\/td>\n<td>Gloss Lamination, Matte Lamination, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Die-Cut Shapes, Reinforced Edges<\/td>\n<td>Retail Boxes, Shipping, Subscription Packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Corrugated (Single\/Dual Wall), Kraft, White SBS<\/td>\n<td>Eco-Friendly Kraft, Recycled Board, Premium SBS<\/td>\n<td>Soft-Touch, Anti-Scratch Coating<\/td>\n<td>FDA-Safe Ink, Water-Resistant Coating<\/td>\n<td>Food, Electronics, Cosmetics<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Printing Methods<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>CMYK, PMS, Spot Color, Interior &amp; Exterior Panels<\/td>\n<td>10pt to 28pt Thickness (60lb\u2013400lb)<\/td>\n<td>Offset, Digital Printing<\/td>\n<td>Logo Branding, QR Codes, Serial Codes<\/td>\n<td>Branding, Promotions, Retail Display<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Coating Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<td>Food-Safe, Eco-Inks<\/td>\n<td>Aqueous, Anti-Scratch, Soft Touch<\/td>\n<td>Gold Foil, Silver Foil, Holographic Effects<\/td>\n<td>Gift Boxes, Premium Packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Finishing Features<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Die-cut Windows, Foil Stamping, Inside Printing<\/td>\n<td>White SBS, Kraft, Recycled Board<\/td>\n<td>Embossing, Debossing, Foiling<\/td>\n<td>Transparent Windows, Custom Cutouts<\/td>\n<td>Product Display, Retail Shelf Packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Box Styles<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Tuck End, Mailer, Two-Piece Lid &amp; Base, Seal End<\/td>\n<td>Kraft, Corrugated, SBS<\/td>\n<td>Matte, Gloss, Satin<\/td>\n<td>Locking Tabs, Divider Inserts<\/td>\n<td>E-commerce, Retail Packaging, Shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Insert Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Paperboard Inserts, Foam, Die-cut Compartments<\/td>\n<td>Kraft, Cardboard, Foam<\/td>\n<td>Gloss or Matte Insert Finishing<\/td>\n<td>Compartments, Cushions, Product Holders<\/td>\n<td>Fragile Products, Cosmetics, Medical Devices<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Food-Safe Options<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>FDA-Approved Coating for Edible Item Packaging<\/td>\n<td>Food-Safe SBS, Kraft<\/td>\n<td>Matte Lamination, Gloss Coating<\/td>\n<td>Greaseproof Layer, Non-Toxic Ink<\/td>\n<td>Bakeries, Restaurants, Takeaway Packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>MOQ<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Minimum 100 Units<\/td>\n<td>Applies Across All Materials<\/td>\n<td>Bulk Order Discounts<\/td>\n<td>Flexible Quantities<\/td>\n<td>Startups, Wholesale, Retailers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Turnaround Time<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>4\u20136 Business Days Standard; Rush Available<\/td>\n<td>All Packaging Types<\/td>\n<td>Rush Spot UV or Foil<\/td>\n<td>Expedited Shipping Available<\/td>\n<td>Businesses With Urgent Orders<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Proof Format<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Flat View, 3D Mock-up, or Physical Sample<\/td>\n<td>Digital or Physical Options<\/td>\n<td>High-Resolution Prints<\/td>\n<td>Custom Design Approvals<\/td>\n<td>Branding &amp; Marketing Teams<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Shipping<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Free Nationwide Delivery<\/td>\n<td>Kraft, Corrugated<\/td>\n<td>Coated Boxes for Weather Safety<\/td>\n<td>Secure Bundling, Pallet Packing<\/td>\n<td>Nationwide &amp; International Shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Design Support<\/strong><\/td>\n<td>Free Artwork and Layout Assistance<\/td>\n<td>Customizable For All Materials<\/td>\n<td>Matte, Gloss, Foil Add-ons<\/td>\n<td>Logo Setup, Branding Adjustments<\/td>\n<td>Businesses Without In-house Designers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<hr data-start=\"3499\" data-end=\"3502\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3560\">Medium Cardboard Boxes and Practical Sizing Solutions<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"3562\" data-end=\"3603\">Designed for Everyday Packaging Needs<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3605\" data-end=\"3861\">Some products don&#8217;t fit the profile of large shipping containers or tiny retail boxes. That\u2019s where <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/medium-cardboard-boxes\/\"><strong data-start=\"3705\" data-end=\"3731\">medium cardboard boxes<\/strong><\/a> provide the right balance. These boxes offer just enough space for medium-sized items while still being easy to handle and store.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"4029\">\n<li data-start=\"3863\" data-end=\"3924\">\n<p data-start=\"3865\" data-end=\"3924\">Used by beauty brands, clothing companies, and bookstores<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3925\" data-end=\"3985\">\n<p data-start=\"3927\" data-end=\"3985\">Can be styled for mailers or displayed in gift packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3986\" data-end=\"4029\">\n<p data-start=\"3988\" data-end=\"4029\">Printed inside and out for added impact<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4031\" data-end=\"4143\">This size category allows for flexible shipping and display use while keeping costs low and materials efficient.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"4145\" data-end=\"4148\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"4150\" data-end=\"4196\">Custom Printing and Premium Coating Options<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4226\">Add Protection and Style<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4228\" data-end=\"4338\">To improve durability and presentation, you can select from various coatings to apply to your rectangle boxes:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4490\">\n<li data-start=\"4340\" data-end=\"4390\">\n<p data-start=\"4342\" data-end=\"4390\">Gloss coating for a smooth and vibrant surface<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4391\" data-end=\"4442\">\n<p data-start=\"4393\" data-end=\"4442\">Matte finish for a clean, soft-touch appearance<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4443\" data-end=\"4490\">\n<p data-start=\"4445\" data-end=\"4490\">Spot UV for highlighting logos or messaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4492\" data-end=\"4585\">These coatings also protect the box from wear, smudging, or external moisture during transit.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"4587\" data-end=\"4630\">Personalized Branding and Color Options<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4632\" data-end=\"4801\">We use high-resolution digital and offset printing to ensure your brand elements stand out. Whether you want a minimalist logo or a full-color product display, we offer:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4803\" data-end=\"4939\">\n<li data-start=\"4803\" data-end=\"4843\">\n<p data-start=\"4805\" data-end=\"4843\">All-over prints or one-side printing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4844\" data-end=\"4880\">\n<p data-start=\"4846\" data-end=\"4880\">Branded messages inside box lids<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4881\" data-end=\"4939\">\n<p data-start=\"4883\" data-end=\"4939\">QR codes or product details printed directly on panels<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4941\" data-end=\"5041\">If you&#8217;re not sure how to prepare your artwork, our design team offers free file setup and feedback.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"5043\" data-end=\"5046\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"5048\" data-end=\"5095\">Why Choose Rectangle Cardboard Boxes in Bulk<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"5097\" data-end=\"5142\">Save Time and Reduce Cost on Large Orders<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5144\" data-end=\"5287\">When ordered in volume, rectangle cardboard boxes help you streamline packing operations and maintain consistent presentation across shipments.<\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"5289\" data-end=\"5498\">\n<li data-start=\"5289\" data-end=\"5337\">\n<p data-start=\"5292\" data-end=\"5337\">Lower per-unit cost on high-quantity orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5338\" data-end=\"5391\">\n<p data-start=\"5341\" data-end=\"5391\">Uniform packaging for product lines or campaigns<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5392\" data-end=\"5436\">\n<p data-start=\"5395\" data-end=\"5436\">Fewer delays due to packaging shortages<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5437\" data-end=\"5498\">\n<p data-start=\"5440\" data-end=\"5498\">Templates saved for easy reorders and design adjustments<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"5500\" data-end=\"5746\">Many clients using medium or large boxes also explore other sizing options through our <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-by-size-and-shape\/\"><strong data-start=\"5587\" data-end=\"5624\">Cardboard Boxes by Size and Shape<\/strong><\/a> . This allows you to manage a packaging system across SKUs while staying aligned with storage and shipping needs.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"5748\" data-end=\"5751\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"5753\" data-end=\"5795\">Easy Ordering with Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"5797\" data-end=\"5830\">Simple Process to Get Started<\/h3>\n<ol data-start=\"5832\" data-end=\"6082\">\n<li data-start=\"5832\" data-end=\"5872\">\n<p data-start=\"5835\" data-end=\"5872\">Submit your required box dimensions<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5873\" data-end=\"5930\">\n<p data-start=\"5876\" data-end=\"5930\">Choose your preferred material, printing, and finish<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5931\" data-end=\"5983\">\n<p data-start=\"5934\" data-end=\"5983\">Upload your artwork or request free design help<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"5984\" data-end=\"6026\">\n<p data-start=\"5987\" data-end=\"6026\">Review your 3D mock-up or flat layout<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6027\" data-end=\"6082\">\n<p data-start=\"6030\" data-end=\"6082\">Approve your order and receive fast, free delivery<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"6084\" data-end=\"6227\">Whether you\u2019re ordering a <strong data-start=\"6110\" data-end=\"6143\">long rectangular shipping box<\/strong> or a gift-ready box for retail shelves, we make the process smooth and hassle-free.<\/p>\n<div class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"419bc3ab-a20a-486a-8734-3d2d41e89952\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark\">\n<h2 data-start=\"6744\" data-end=\"6789\">Why Shop Cardboard Boxes Is a Smart Choice<\/h2>\n<ul data-start=\"6791\" data-end=\"7182\">\n<li data-start=\"6791\" data-end=\"6855\">\n<p data-start=\"6793\" data-end=\"6855\">Custom rectangle cardboard boxes built to match your product<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6856\" data-end=\"6911\">\n<p data-start=\"6858\" data-end=\"6911\">Coating options including Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6912\" data-end=\"6969\">\n<p data-start=\"6914\" data-end=\"6969\">Printed interiors, logos, and brand visuals available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6970\" data-end=\"7026\">\n<p data-start=\"6972\" data-end=\"7026\">Fast turnaround and free shipping across the country<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7027\" data-end=\"7075\">\n<p data-start=\"7029\" data-end=\"7075\">Eco-friendly and recyclable material options<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7076\" data-end=\"7131\">\n<p data-start=\"7078\" data-end=\"7131\">Boxes for gifting, retail, and long-format shipping<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7132\" data-end=\"7182\">\n<p data-start=\"7134\" data-end=\"7182\">Affordable wholesale pricing with low minimums<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"7184\" data-end=\"7306\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"7184\" data-end=\"7306\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Contact us today to request a free quote and start designing your Rectangle Cardboard Boxes with Shop Cardboard Boxes.<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardb